  "releaseNotes": "[Add] IArgusClient interface\n            [Add] queryparameters\n            [Add] Accept header as first class citizen on ArgusRequest; fixes #1\n            [Add] content negotiation with IArgusBodySerializerRegistry; fixes #1\n            [Add] timeout per request; fixes #4\n            [Add] request timesout; fixes #114\n            [Add] statuscode 401 and 403; fixes #8\n            [Add] statuscode 409, 501 and 503; fixes #9 and #10\n            [Add] statuscode 204 and 422; fixes #13 and fixes #12\n            [Add] HEAD verb returns no body; fixes #24\n            [Add] max body size checking; fixes #15\n            [Add] graceful shutdown with in-flight request draining; fixes #16\n            [Add] concurrency gating; fixes #17\n            [Add] Add streaming body support for large payloads fixes #7",
